title: "NEXUS: Deterministic Centre-Transit Field Engine with Ternary Lanes, SHA-256 Ledgers, and a Reversible Cuboctahedral Lattice"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MPL-2.0
authors:
  - family-names: "<surname>"
    given-names: "<given names>"
repository-code: "<repository url>"
abstract: >-
  Deterministic Rust engine for centre-transit fields with exact integer
  strand selection, ternary execution metadata, order-preserving parallel
  evaluation, lane-separated SHA-256 ledgers, sonification controls, an
  invariant audit, a twelve-direction cuboctahedral atlas, and an exactly
  reversible coupled Z_4 lattice with a CPU reference and an optional
  Vulkan/WGSL mirror.
